<name>WPI 3178233 Granite St (US-1) Westerly RI - poles derived from the drawing</name>
<description>DERIVED, NOT SURVEYED. Positions of P.33 to P.39 were read from the drawing sheets by registering each sheet image to an Azure Maps image centred on P32. Check at P.32: the drawing box landed 0.7 m from the KML point. P.40, P.41, P.42 and P.42-2 (sheets 5 and 6) are not georeferenced. P.35 does not appear on the drawing. Meaning of the label P.38-50 is unknown. Estimated position error 3 to 5 m (unverified except at P.32).</description>
